#: src/onboarding.py:217 src/onboarding.glade:467
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello will scan your face twice: once now, and once more in dif"
"ferent lighting (for example evening lamps instead of daylight), so it"
" recognises you reliably at any time of day. Press Scan to record the "
"first model."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ýüzüňizi iki gezek gözden geçirer: bir gezek, ýene bir ge"
"zek dürli yşyklandyryşda (mysal üçin gündiziň ýerine agşam çyralary), "
"şonuň üçin sizi günüň islendik wagtynda ygtybarly tanar. Ilkinji model"
"i ýazdyrmak üçin Scan basyň."

