msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ýüz tanamaklyk (tapylan gapjyk: {}) ulanyp, {}-y awtomati"
"ki açyp biler.\n\n<b> TPM ýagdaýy: </b> TPM enjamlary tapyldy, ýöne <i"
"> tpm2-tools </i> awtomatiki gurnamak şowsuz boldy. <code> sudo apt in"
"stall tpm2-tools </code> işlediň. Programma üpjünçiligine esaslanýan ş"
"ahsyýet keş görnüşine gaýdyp gelmek."

#: src/onboarding.py:854
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detecte"
"d. Using software-based credential caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ýüz tanamaklyk (tapylan gapjyk: {}) ulanyp, {}-y awtomati"
"ki açyp biler.\n\n<b> TPM ýagdaýy: </b> TPM enjamy tapylmady. Programm"
"a üpjünçiligine esaslanýan şahsyýet keşini (AES-256-GCM) ulanmak."

